style=\"text-align: right;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">קפד ראשו</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></h3></div><div><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium;\"><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\"><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">אהל - הל<br />אמרי - מרי<br />אשל - של<br />ארם - רם<br />בקר - קר<br />גרר - רר<br />דבר - בר<br />השב - שב<br />הגר - גר<br />זקן - קן<br />זרע - רע<br />חמאה - מאה<br />חדל - דל<br />חתן - תן<br />חלום - לום<br />חזו - זו<br />ילד - לד<br />ככר - כר<br />למה - מה<br />מעט - עט<br />מלח - לח<br />מאומה - אומה<br />נעריו - עריו<br />נחור - חור<br /></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">סדום - דום<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">עצים - צים<br />עפר - פר<br />פקד - קד<br />צחוק - חוק<br />קרב - רב<br />רחצו - חצו<br />ראומה - אומה<br /></span><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\" style=\"background-color: white;\">שפחות - פחות<br /><span face=\"Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif\">שאי - אי</span><br /></span></span></div><div><span><span><span><span><span><span><span><span class=\"KB0Tx C9DxTc\" style=\"font-size: medium;\"><h3 style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; text-align: right; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-size: medium; font-variant-ligatures: none; text-decoration-line: inherit;\">מדרגאות</span></h3><p style=\"box-sizing: border-box; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-position: normal; line-height: 1.6667; margin: 12px 0px 0px; outline: none; padding-bottom: 0px; position: relative; vertical-align: baseline;\"><span style=\"font-family: arial;\"><span style=\"font-variant-ligatures: none;\">צי,&nbsp;</span></span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">צין,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">נציב,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">נצבים,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">צבים,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">צים,&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: arial; font-variant-ligatures: none;\">ים</span></p></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div>"
